# P7-16: the Today board on the sleep screen (docs/POWER.md "Sleep screen"). One Home Assistant with the phone's calendar
# (the relay, fixture ha-agenda.example.test) and the weather (weather.thuis); today is Thursday 15 January 2026, 13:34.
# The board at power-off, after a scheduled refresh two hours later, with a book open, and switched off in Settings.
wait 1700               # (1.5 s after the launcher came up it read the relay: the agenda and "4 unread" are there)
tap 438 628             # the Weather tile: the first place is read and saved
wait 1500
back
wait 900
power-off
shot today-board
restart
wait 1700
tap 270 452             # Settings
wait 900
tap 270 364             # Power
wait 900
tap 270 425             # wake to update the sleep screen every: 2 h
wait 900
shot today-board-setting
back
wait 900
back
wait 900
timer-wake              # sleep screen, two hours pass, the alarm boots the device: the relay and the weather are read
wait 4000
shot today-board-refreshed
expect-off 7200
restart
wait 1700
tap 100 276             # Read
wait 900
tap 270 178             # the book
wait 1500
power-off
shot today-board-book
restart
wait 2000               # the book is open again
tap 270 500             # its menu
wait 900
tap 432 900             # Library
wait 900
back                    # the launcher
wait 900
tap 270 452             # Settings
wait 900
tap 270 364             # Power
wait 900
tap 470 525             # Today on the sleep screen: off
wait 900
back
wait 900
back
wait 900
power-off               # the plain screen: the mark, one agenda line, the unread count
shot today-board-off
